From 4726b23a4ead5ab9d234a93d01260d7022a2b7d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arockiasathish S <arocs@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 18:54:17 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] [RDK][MESH] bpl: persist backhaul credentials and profile  in
 qmesh.json

  bpl_cfg_get_wifi_credentials() and bpl_cfg_set_sta_vap_bh_credentials()
  now read and write backhaul credentials in the qmesh.json config block,
  allowing credentials to survive agent restarts.  cfg_get_sta_iface() is
  implemented, and bpl_cfg_get_agent_multi_ap_profile() reads from
  qmesh.json (defaulting to profile 3)

Signed-off-by: Arockiasathish S <arocs@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 framework/platform/bpl/cfg/rdk/bpl_cfg.cpp   | 251 ++++++++++++++++++-
 framework/platform/bpl/include/bpl/bpl_cfg.h |  16 ++
 2 files changed, 259 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/framework/platform/bpl/cfg/rdk/bpl_cfg.cpp b/framework/platform/bpl/cfg/rdk/bpl_cfg.cpp
